# Local Preview Before Commit

After finishing an implementation that changes the site:

1. Serve locally from the repo root with `npx --yes serve .` if a preview server is not already running
2. Open the printed local URL in the browser (usually `http://localhost:3000`) so the user can test
3. Do not commit or push to GitHub unless the user explicitly asks after testing

Never open `file://` URLs — JSON fetches break that way.
